<title>USA: Kansas feedlot cattle, Friday roundup - USDA.</title>
<headline>Kansas feedlot cattle, Friday roundup - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DODGE CITY 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade quiet. No sales of slaughter steers or heifers confirmed. Inquiry moderate, demand very light. Week-to-date including late Friday and over the weekend on 4,400 head. - USDA</p>
</text>
